§§ `Article 47: the regulative rules`

-- No rule below states a time limit or a consequence, so none can reach BREACH (NOTES.md, Rules with no breach path (P5)). Nothing is owed (FULFILLED) where the group does not apply, Art 111(2) saves the system, or the text's own gate fails.
@ref Art 47(1) first sentence
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the route to high-risk` IS A `Route to high-risk`
      `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` IS A DATE
      `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the requirements for high-risk AI systems under this Regulation have been integrated in that Union harmonisation legislation` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC Role `Art 47 act`
`Art 47(1) the provider's duty to draw up an EU declaration of conformity` MEANS
    CONSIDER `Art 47(1) the provider must draw up an EU declaration of conformity for the high-risk AI system` `the date asked` `the route to high-risk` `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` `the requirements for high-risk AI systems under this Regulation have been integrated in that Union harmonisation legislation`
    WHEN JUST TRUE THEN PARTY Provider MUST `Art 47(1) draw up an EU declaration of conformity`
    OTHERWISE FULFILLED  -- nothing is owed on these facts

