§§ `Article 48: the regulative rules`

-- No time limit and no consequence in the text: no breach path (NOTES.md, Rules with no breach path (P5)).
@ref Art 48(2)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the route to high-risk` IS A `Route to high-risk`
      `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` IS A DATE
      `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the requirements for high-risk AI systems under this Regulation have been integrated in that Union harmonisation legislation` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the high-risk AI system is provided digitally` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the digital CE marking can easily be accessed via the interface from which the system is accessed` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the digital CE marking can easily be accessed via an easily accessible machine-readable code or other electronic means` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC Role `Art 48 act`
`Art 48(2) the provider's duty to use a digital CE marking` MEANS
    CONSIDER `Art 48(2) a digital CE marking must be used` `the date asked` `the route to high-risk` `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` `the requirements for high-risk AI systems under this Regulation have been integrated in that Union harmonisation legislation` `the high-risk AI system is provided digitally`
    WHEN JUST TRUE THEN
        CONSIDER `Art 48(2) the digital CE marking may be used` `the date asked` `the route to high-risk` `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` `the requirements for high-risk AI systems under this Regulation have been integrated in that Union harmonisation legislation` `the high-risk AI system is provided digitally` `the digital CE marking can easily be accessed via the interface from which the system is accessed` `the digital CE marking can easily be accessed via an easily accessible machine-readable code or other electronic means`
        WHEN JUST TRUE THEN PARTY Provider MUST `Art 48(2) use a digital CE marking`
        OTHERWISE FULFILLED  -- the marking cannot be used where it is not easily accessed: nothing is owed
    OTHERWISE FULFILLED  -- nothing is owed on these facts

@ref Art 48(3)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the route to high-risk` IS A `Route to high-risk`
      `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` IS A DATE
      `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the requirements for high-risk AI systems under this Regulation have been integrated in that Union harmonisation legislation` IS A BOOLEAN
      `affixing the CE marking to the system is not possible or not warranted on account of the nature of the high-risk AI system` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the packaging is the appropriate place` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC Role `Art 48 act`
`Art 48(3) the provider's duty to affix the CE marking` MEANS
    CONSIDER `Art 48(3) where the CE marking must be affixed` `the date asked` `the route to high-risk` `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` `the requirements for high-risk AI systems under this Regulation have been integrated in that Union harmonisation legislation` `affixing the CE marking to the system is not possible or not warranted on account of the nature of the high-risk AI system` `the packaging is the appropriate place`
    WHEN JUST `Art 48(3) on the high-risk AI system, visibly, legibly and indelibly` THEN PARTY Provider MUST `Art 48(3) affix the CE marking visibly, legibly and indelibly`
    WHEN JUST `Art 48(3) on the packaging` THEN PARTY Provider MUST `Art 48(3) affix the CE marking to the packaging or to the accompanying documentation`
    WHEN JUST `Art 48(3) on the accompanying documentation` THEN PARTY Provider MUST `Art 48(3) affix the CE marking to the packaging or to the accompanying documentation`
    OTHERWISE FULFILLED  -- nothing is owed on these facts

@ref Art 48(4) first sentence
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the route to high-risk` IS A `Route to high-risk`
      `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` IS A DATE
      `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the requirements for high-risk AI systems under this Regulation have been integrated in that Union harmonisation legislation` IS A BOOLEAN
      `a notified body is responsible for the conformity assessment procedures set out in Article 43` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC Role `Art 48 act`
`Art 48(4) the provider's duty to follow the CE marking with the identification number` MEANS
    CONSIDER `Art 48(4) the CE marking must be followed by the identification number of the notified body` `the date asked` `the route to high-risk` `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` `the requirements for high-risk AI systems under this Regulation have been integrated in that Union harmonisation legislation` `a notified body is responsible for the conformity assessment procedures set out in Article 43`
    WHEN JUST TRUE THEN PARTY Provider MUST `Art 48(4) follow the CE marking with the identification number of the notified body`
    OTHERWISE FULFILLED  -- nothing is owed on these facts

@ref Art 48(4) second sentence
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the route to high-risk` IS A `Route to high-risk`
      `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` IS A DATE
      `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the requirements for high-risk AI systems under this Regulation have been integrated in that Union harmonisation legislation` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person who affixes the number` IS A `Art 48(4) affixer`
      `the notified body has instructed the person to affix the number` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC Role `Art 48 act`
`Art 48(4) the permission to affix the identification number of the notified body` MEANS
    CONSIDER `Art 48(4) the person may affix the identification number of the notified body` `the date asked` `the route to high-risk` `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` `the requirements for high-risk AI systems under this Regulation have been integrated in that Union harmonisation legislation` `the person who affixes the number` `the notified body has instructed the person to affix the number`
    WHEN JUST TRUE THEN
        CONSIDER `the person who affixes the number`
        WHEN `Art 48(4) the notified body itself` THEN PARTY `Notified body` MAY `Art 48(4) affix the identification number of the notified body`
        WHEN `Art 48(4) the provider, under the instructions of the notified body` THEN PARTY Provider MAY `Art 48(4) affix the identification number of the notified body`
        WHEN `Art 48(4) the provider's authorised representative, under the instructions of the notified body` THEN PARTY `Authorised representative` MAY `Art 48(4) affix the identification number of the notified body`
    OTHERWISE FULFILLED  -- nothing is permitted here on these facts

